.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787755997781-f1775106-19dd-428c-9d8c-194b7d7b61e5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787756102210-774d0d7f-e11f-48ed-aaf8-8d9e858986c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>14.字符串的操作</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787760857782-154e5a2b-d882-4284-b6fa-5bfc35eeeb7a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787760836770-c23017ca-daeb-44d7-9922-1d3e04ba4493.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761035237-ba9330cf-5b75-4922-bee2-1608c9dfaaf0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761088592-2c1b931a-922a-43e7-9158-83e3852f2405.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761132953-583c2f9a-47ab-42c6-a5ba-2beb48c6be7f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>15.字符串常用的函数</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761171605-2e14663b-f0af-411b-b6a3-5d245e648476.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761229588-b5a0d913-cf52-433d-be98-5afdc442132a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761292432-6fa571ca-cd0e-4f88-8bd9-feb080eddb5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>这个是按前两个空格切的</strong><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761329886-f58b9002-766a-4b4d-b6d9-3faee84cd04b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787761370488-b400eab4-d3ed-4d78-a748-d2f75b8163af.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要是找一个不存在的